       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for adults in a monitored setting, which is 3,200 mg/day. Even 1600 mg in a single dose is above the normal maximum of 800 mg per dose. A dose this high raises the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury and cardiovascular events.\n\nWhich of these did you intend?\n- **400 mg by mouth four times daily** (1,600 mg/day total)\n- **800 mg by mouth three times daily** (2,400 mg/day total)\n- **800 mg by mouth four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **600 mg by mouth four times daily** (2,400 mg/day total)\n- Another dose you have in mind\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and I'll add a note to the order. I'd advise against it, though."
